#   ..._the_two_variants_share_every_machine_read_field  only the EXAMPLES may
#                                                        differ; the parsed
#                                                        half must not
#   ..._a_stream_agent_obeying_its_block_becomes_visible_to_liveness  end to end
#
# GRIND cycle 5 added the D-058 adjacent-path section. test_liveness.py proves
# the roster union against spawns.log records the test wrote itself, which
# proves nothing about whether either spawn tool emits a record the reader can
# key. These drive the real WRITERS into the real reader — a different caller
# than the defect path — so the field names, the casting_id type and the phase
# spelling are checked against what production writes:
#   ..._a_real_bulk_dispatch_becomes_a_liveness_row     foundry_cast_wave
#   ..._a_real_single_dispatch_becomes_a_liveness_row   foundry_spawn_teammate
#   ..._the_row_points_at_the_path_the_spawn_block_told_the_agent_to_write
#                                                   the loop closed in its
#                                                   FAILURE state: the path the
#                                                   block names and the path the
