#   ..._an_agent_that_obeys_its_block_leaves_the_missing_roster   the fix is
#                                                   self-clearing, not a row
#                                                   that can only be added
#
# TEMPER cycle 6 added the D-115 section. A manifest that is valid JSON of the
# WRONG TYPE — `[1,2,3]`, `null`, a bare string — parses cleanly past the
# JSONDecodeError handler and then meets `.get()`, which is an AttributeError
# raised across the MCP boundary from a module whose error contract is a named
