#                                                   they cannot drift apart
#   ..._a_torn_manifest_keeps_the_parse_error_it_already_had   the correct path
#   ..._a_well_formed_manifest_is_untouched_by_the_guard       is unchanged
#   ..._the_grind_context_builder_survives_a_wrong_typed_manifest   the third
